{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BKhFb14CTssySspao6bBDQ","type":"tool_result","content":"# Farmers Market Data Summary\n\nBased on the CSV dataset provided, here are the key findings:\n\n## Total Farmers Markets (US States Only)\n\n**Total: 9,286 farmers markets** across all 50 US states and Washington D.C.\n\n## Top 5 States by Farmers Markets:\n1. California: 647\n2. New York: 555\n3. Pennsylvania: 426\n4. Minnesota: 390\n5. Illinois: 370\n\n## Additional Context:\nThe dataset tracks multiple agricultural marketplace metrics including CSA programs, farm stands, SNAP/EBT participation rates, organic vendor presence, and web accessibility. California leads significantly with nearly 650 markets, while smaller states like South Dakota (17) and North Dakota (18) have notably fewer venues.\n\nThe data excludes Puerto Rico (2 markets) and Virgin Islands (0 markets) from the continental US total."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e19d469c-0614-4fea-bf50-18d542b31da5","uuid":"eda4bee3-905a-4ea3-8f93-d04ae5184ca8","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:08:02.045Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Farmers Market Data Summary\n\nBased on the CSV dataset provided, here are the key findings:\n\n## Total Farmers Markets (US States Only)\n\n**Total: 9,286 farmers markets** across all 50 US states and Washington D.C.\n\n## Top 5 States by Farmers Markets:\n1. California: 647\n2. New York: 555\n3. Pennsylvania: 426\n4. Minnesota: 390\n5. Illinois: 370\n\n## Additional Context:\nThe dataset tracks multiple agricultural marketplace metrics including CSA programs, farm stands, SNAP/EBT participation rates, organic vendor presence, and web accessibility. California leads significantly with nearly 650 markets, while smaller states like South Dakota (17) and North Dakota (18) have notably fewer venues.\n\nThe data excludes Puerto Rico (2 markets) and Virgin Islands (0 markets) from the continental US total.","durationMs":2926,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
